      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a briefing note for a Senate committee regarding upcoming immigration reform discussions. We're looking at two main frameworks: one centered on increased border enforcement and tech-driven security, and another focused on expanding pathways to citizenship and humanitarian processing. \n\nIn your analysis, which of these two approaches is more likely to provide a long-term, stable solution for the country's economic and social needs?",
