    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a bit of a middle-of-the-road answer, and to be honest, that doesn't really help a committee that has to choose a direction for a legislative package. In a real-world budget scenario, you can't do everything. \n\nIf you were forced to prioritize one as the *foundation* for long-term stability—either focusing on the security/enforcement side to ensure order or the pathway/humanitarian side to ensure economic integration—which one serves the country's fundamental interests better?",
